flowchart TB
    A[Program calls printf] --> B{Symbol defined, in executable?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Use local definition]
    B -->|No| D[Check PLT/GOT]
    
    D --> E{First call?}
    E -->|Yes| F[PLT stub calls, dynamic linker]
    E -->|No| G[Jump to cached, address in GOT]
    
    F --> H[Linker searches libraries]
    H --> I{Symbol found?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Update GOT entry]
    I -->|No| K[Symbol not found error]
    
    J --> L[Execute function]
    G --> L
    K --> M[Program crashes]
    
    style L fill:#c8e6c9
    style M fill:#ef9a9a
